      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-05-26_WidnesExaminer_art0122" n="art0122">
        <head>Clyde Ship-Joiner's Suffering from Liver and Kidney Disorder Ended by Bile Beans</head>
        <p>Clyde Ship-Joiner's Suffering from Liver and Kidney Disorder Ended by Bile Beans</p>
        <p>Pursuing his daily avocation as a ship's joiner in the world-famed Fairfield Shipyard, is Mr. Andrew Broaman, who lives at 34, James-place, Govan, Lanarkshire, Scotland. Spite of his 67 years, Mr. Brooman still applies himself vigorously to his task of assisting in building the great ocean leviathans which have made Fairfield Shipyard famous. But he was not always thus, for until Bile Beans cured him liver and kidney trouble made his life thoroughly miserable, and finally prevented him working. , "1 was racked with pain," he told a newspaper representative recently. " lly feet became swollen,and I was tormented by a pain at the right side of my back, ingt above the hip. I couldn't lie down, and sleep was impossible. A taste like rancid butter was in my mouth after everything I ate, and I became absolutely afraid to take food. Finally I had to give up work and go to a doctor. He treated me first for lumbago aud then for kidney trouble. But one bottle of medicine became two, two became three, and so on; and all the time I was gradually getting worse. "I was rapidly breaking up, when I read about Bile Beans. I decided to give up doctors' medicine and give Bile Beans a fair trial. So I bought a 2s. 9d. box, and before half the contents were finished I felt a changed individual. I persevered with Bile Beans, and theimprovement continued until I was able to resume work. I continued to derive benefit from the Paans, and now I regard myself as strong and as well as ever I was." Bile Beans for Biliousness are an acknowledged cure for all the ills resulting from disorders of the digestive organs. Their great success is due to their pure vege- table origin. Don't waste money on worthless substitutes. Bile Beans may be had of all chemists, at is. lid. or 2s. 9tl. per box, or post free for same prices from the Bile Bean Co., Red Cross-street, London. •</p>
