      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-05-26_WidnesExaminer_art0173" n="art0173">
        <head>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR. REDUCING LICENCES.</head>
        <p>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR. REDUCING LICENCES.</p>
        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS. Authors of letters intended for publication must in MEETING OF THE WARRINGTON all cases send their names and addresses to the Editor COMPENSATION AUTHORITY. sea guarantee of good faith.</p>
